*value = "Look in each hidden grove\nAmong the towering trees\nWhen for each one you've strove\nSix souls you will set free"
*key = 12
*value = "Every shard of blue\nPlays a similar part\nAs those of other hues\nIn forming a Wraithheart"
*key = 13
*value = "Relics wrecked lay in rot\nWhat mystery transpired?\nHeads up, mind this caveat:\nSome assembly required"
*key = 14
*value = "Above the mucky muck\nAfloat upon the air\nA ride of skill or luck?\nA prize for those who dare"
*key = 15
*value = "Glyphs in roots give access\nTo an arbor sick\nOnce there to find success\nAvoid the floor, it's slick"
*key = 16
*value = "In the temple you'll find\nA game of gathering\nBest three more of your kind\nAnd get the Temple Rings"
*key = 17
*value = "An Ancient temple wall\nContains a mystery\nReturn before the fall\nAnd join its history"
*key = 18
*value = "A Wraithheart you'll behold\nAnd claim it for your own\nJust get the shards of gold\nIn this adventure zone"
*key = 19
*value = "A reward is concealed\nSomewhere 'twixt pitch and knoll\nFor it to be revealed\nJust keep in mind your goal"
*key = 20
*value = "Once you've earned your wings\nYou will have gained the edge\nTo get the magick thing\nBeyond the farthest ledge"
*key = 21
*value = "A one-way portal calls\nSundial tells the time\nHidden gateway opens halls\nMissed chance would be a crime"
*key = 22
*value = "At the hidden hour\nA doppelganger waits\nTo use your every power\nTo beat you in a race"
*key = 23
*value = "Across the lands the letters\nOf a lost and noble race\nGain 6 in this world and find\nIt's not a futile chase"
*key = 24
*value = "You may have found reward\nKicking this into place\nIf one more you can hoard\nJust complete the brace"
*key = 25
*value = "Beneath the dragon's grasp\nWhere time did make him stop\nYou must move twice as fast\nTo win at Drop and Hop"
*key = 26
*value = "Where Dragon's heart did beat\nA doorway with suspense\nWithin use gauntlets' heat\nTo loose some things immense"
*key = 27
*value = "Beyond the fossil's grasp\nA ship floats in the air\nJust thread the banded path\nWith wings to get you there"
*key = 28
*value = "Find a pulsing treasure\nOn an ancient knuckle\nTake care in each measure\nOr it just may buckle"
*key = 29
*value = "The spirits of the damned\nTrapped in eternal pain\nCan be found throughout this land\nAmong earthly remains"
*key = 30
*value = "Grisly shards of red\nIn complete collection\n Will aid, it has been said\nIn a heart's detection"
*key = 31
*value = "This age-old citadel\nDid time and sand devour\nIts hazards you must quell\nTo scale its inner tower"
*key = 32
*value = "The temple of Nanyk\nLies buried in the sand\nHead up to make three clicks\nAnd try for one last stand"
*key = 33
*value = "In a hidden chamber\nAwaits a shattered climb\nAscend through the danger\nAnd reward you'll find"
*key = 34
*value = "A riddle of three rings\nBlocks access to a hall\nIf fighting is your thing\nYou're sure to have a ball"
*key = 35
*value = "While 'cross the walls you crawl\nThe Soul Jars can be found\nMiss a jump and you'll fall\nA long way to the ground"
*key = 36
*value = "Each of the shards of blue\nPlays a similar part\nAs those of other hues\nIn forming a Wraithheart"
*key = 37
*value = "A monk is ill at ease\nIn his meditation\nA horde of enemies\nNeed extermination"
*key = 38
*value = "Some rewards you earn\nBy leaping, fighting, dashing\nThese skills were wise to learn\nBut this one's simply smashing"
*key = 39
*value = "To add juice to the rift\nAnd get your wings unfurled\nYou just may need a lift\nFor flight across the world"
*key = 40
*value = "Reward awaits discovery\nBut who will earn the crown?\nEnemies may thwart recovery\nBut don't let them get you down"
*key = 41
*value = "Outside a holy shrine\nThese hopeless souls are trapped\nIf all six you can find\nA heart will be untapped"
*key = 42
*value = "A Wraithheart you'll behold\nAnd claim it for your own\nJust get the shards of gold\nIn this adventure zone"
*key = 43
*value = "Death's jaw, you'll discover\nIs a traveler's nexus\nOnce you've learned to hover\nSeek a beacon precious"
*key = 44
*value = "Across the lands the letters\nOf a lost and noble race\nGain 6 in this world and find\nIt's not a futile chase"
*key = 45
*value = "A one-way portal calls\nSundial tells the time\nHidden gateway opens halls\nMissed chance would be a crime"
*key = 46
*value = "In some hidden hour\nA doppelganger waits\nTo use your every power\nTo beat you in a race"
*key = 47
*value = "An age-old monolith\nStands as a towering sun\nUnearth its secret if\nIts guns you can outrun"
*key = 48
*value = "After you infiltrate\nYour rival's inner base\nYou can alter the fate\nWithin this holy place"
*key = 49
*value = "Head awash in hazard\nAwaits to test your fears\nGain a heart if you're not\nWet behind the ears"
*key = 50
*value = "The head of the machine\nWhere gears and pistons churn\nOne must be quick and keen\nOr else your flesh will burn"
*key = 51
*value = "A monument undone\nA monumental task\nFor reward to be won\nThe work must be a blast"
*key = 52
*value = "The lady of the lake\nHolds a grizzly beacon\nA path through rings can make\nHer stoic grasp weaken"
*key = 53
*value = "These remnants of the dead\nAre spread about the heights\nSearch every massive head\nA prize will come in sight"
*key = 54
*value = "Grisly shards of red\nIn complete collection\n Will aid, it has been said\nIn a heart's detection"
*key = 55
*value = "Ebony, Ivory\nAnd Each Color Between\nDissonance, Harmony\n'neath the piano strings"
*key = 56
*value = "Time it waits for no one\nThe works of peril spin\nFace glowing like a sun\nHides reward within"
*key = 57
*value = "If you play it clean\nDespite your lack of size\nYou'll break out of the screen\nA console-ation prize"
*key = 58
*value = "Icy Ledge of danger\nA mountain's shadow hides\nFear must be a stranger\nTo gain the prize inside"
*key = 59
*value = "Upon a chandelier\nAre trapped these poor spirits\nTo make a heart appear\nAllow your steps to steer it"
*key = 60
*value = "Every shard of blue\nPlays a similar part\nAs those of other hues\nIn forming a Wraithheart"
*key = 61
*value = "Islets snake through the sky\nBeyond the largest claw\nFind a prize up so high\nAbove the Talon's Maw"
*key = 62
*value = "Seek the broken claw\nAnd journey to the peak\nYou'll find a battle raw\nA game not for the weak"
*key = 63
*value = "A gangly, lurching goon\nWill play you for a fool\nTo gain his prize's boon\nTry for a family jewel"
*key = 64
*value = "Trip a clandestine path\nAnd to its route adhere\nAvoid every foe's wrath\nA heart there will appear"
*key = 65
*value = "Around the Talon spires\nThere is a Soul Jar stash\nBut if your wings expire\nTo the ground you will crash"
*key = 66
*value = "A Wraithheart you'll behold\nAnd claim it for your own\nJust get the shards of gold\nIn this adventure zone"
*key = 67
*value = "An isle alone in space\nBeyond where you can climb\nCan get a heart encased\nAnd just in smashing time"
*key = 68
*value = "A heart is held a captive\nTo free it is a pain\nYour goal is adaptive\nYour work is down the drain"
